Description: R package companion to MatriSpace for identification and
    visualization of spatially-resolved extracellular matrix gene expression
    patterns. Provides the core workflows used in the MatriSpace ecosystem,
    including matrisome scoring, ECM niche annotation, differential expression,
    spatial statistics, matrisome-pair co-expression scoring, and visualization for
    Seurat and SpatialExperiment objects.
